{1141}{28c
All humanoids in Arcanum cannot go as fast as they could
Eight-teen is the fastest speed that they can now
except from the blessed and small gnomes and halflings
that can go as fast as twenty-two.
}
{1142}{28c
Harm is now classed as fatigue damage, and many creatures have
been blessed from the gods to be immune to certain spells
because the Gods so love them.
So follower of the Arcane heed this advice: 
Rely not upon one spell only, but upon many.
}


{1150}{28c

Creatures in the wilderness now run together so 
beware, foolish adventurer, wishing to exploit creatures of the land 
for easy training.
Also know, adventure,r that if ever you
 progress enough to reach level 35,
the wild things of Arcanum will know and respect you,
and there will be no more random encounters to be had.
}
{1151}{28c
The Gods favor the bold but not the one to be so bold 
as to rise above level 48 and challenge their power.
Prepare to complete your quest and leave this domain fast,
foolish adventurer, if ever you become so experienced,
or be prepared to feel the wrath of the Gods.
}

{1160}{28c

Gods can give you  the ability to use
 powerful metamagic
 (not affected by magic power) weapons.
These weapons have a chance to cast powerful spells
 than can greatly damage your opponents 
and/or heal you or your followers.

Regeneration will now make you hit harder
Reflection shield will now bless you with more perception
And Tempus Fugit will bless you with fire resistance.
}

{1170}{28c
Stat requirements: For all Adventurers 
Fire Divine Weapons: Beauty 12 Intelligence 12
Electrical Divine Weapons: Beauty 12 Perception 12
Normal Damage Divine Weapons: Perception 12 Intelligence 12
Healing Divine Weapons:Beauty 10 Perception 10 Intelligence 10
Great Prismatic Divine Weapons: Beauty 16  Intelligence 16
PrismHarm Divine Weapons: Beauty 16 Perception 16
Moorindal Blessed Weapons: Beauty 18 Level 20
Poison Divine Weapons: Perception 12 Level 12

}
{1171}{28c
Spirited weapons have no stat requirements.
But failure to hit your target may have
bad  consequences for you.
}

{1180}{28c
Shrine of Revelation.
Once experienced, once aged,
Once tested of body and mind,
This shrine will reveal
Locations unreal
And lost to Arcanum in Time.
}
{1181}{28c
This Shrine will give you the coordinates
of new locations once you are level 35.
}

