{1270}{28c


Althea advice about premarital sex. 

  God has given the beautiful and wonderful gift of sex to be engaged in within the marriage union to make that marriage union unique. Sexual intercourse within marriage is for this reason good and of great blessing both to the couple and to the Panarii church. However, premarital sex creates a conflict of soul and body that can result in real soul damage occurring between the two people involved. Premarital sex is not God's design or plan. 
 

Run away from the sexual sin of premarital sex. Because premarital sex is a sin against your own body.

Althea.

}

{1280}{28c


You are very tired emotionally and physically from the accident . Two strangers carry you on their back for a long way to 
a village that you will lated find out that it is called Shrouded Hills. At the way they had to face a hired assassin that they have identified him to be a member of a criminal organization know only as the Molochean Hand. While you understand that these two strangers are on your side something is worrying you about them .They seem to be Panaarii fanatics and you do not feel comfortable with that .

}

